  "精确原合同": [
    {
      "stage": "window initialrestore",
      "function": "f0187d0→f0775a8",
      "contract": "原初始化MainWindowNSPanel后restoreframe，setFrameUsingName(originalName)若true不再clamp/重置/保存；false且当前frame.height!=332时保x/y/width、改height332，displaytrue/animatefalse，save原name；若false但height已332，则无save。随后layoutIfNeeded使min/maxsize当前frame，安装10高handle。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "handle installation",
      "function": "f07767c→f07836c",
      "contract": "窗口contentView内add原ResizeHandle，top=contentView.top、leading/trailing同contentView、height10；callbacks弱窗口onLiveResize=f0780f8，onEndResize=f0781cc，onResetSize=f0782b8。默认sizeResetClickCount2。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "mouseDown",
      "function": "f0925c8",
      "contract": "super.mouseDown(event)，initialLocation=event.locationInWindow，initialWindowSize=window?.frame.size；clickCount==2时调用onResetSize。仍存两snapshot，不另阻止双击drag。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "mouseDragged",
      "function": "f092794",
      "contract": "super.mouseDragged(event)，两个snapshot均非nil才onLiveResize(CGSize(width:initialWidth,height:initialHeight-(initialY-currentY)))；xdelta不用，不猜屏幕绝对鼠标坐标。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "live resistance",
      "function": "f0780f8",
      "contract": "弱window存在才继续。h<252→252-round(sqrt(252-h)); h>412→412+round(sqrt(h-412)); 其余h。ARM fsqrt+frinta验证round(.toNearestOrAwayFromZero)。保当前window.frame.origin，width来自initialWindowSize.width，height用阻尼值；setFrame(display:false)，无animate/无save/无UserDefaults写。原Ghidra伪代码漏了此sqrt阻尼，不能仅读伪码声称unclamped。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "mouseUp",
      "function": "f0926d4",
      "contract": "super.mouseUp(event)，先initialLocation=nil、initialWindowSize=nil；仅clickCount<2调用onEndResize，无需snapshot仍存在的额外guard。doubleclickreset的mouseUp不再end-save。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "end resize",
      "function": "f0781cc",
      "contract": "弱window存在则h=min(max(currentFrame.height,252),412)，保x/y/currentwidth，setFrame(display:true,animate:true)，saveFrameUsingName(originalName)。即使height已在区间也set/save。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "doubleclick reset",
      "function": "f0782b8",
      "contract": "弱window存在且frame.height!=332时保x/y/width、height332、setFrame(display:true,animate:true)、save原key；已332则不重设或保存。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "show positioning",
      "function": "f0192b0",
      "contract": "生产show取NSScreen.main，window/contentView皆存在时window.frame=(screen.frame.origin,screen.frame.width,contentView.frame.height)，displayfalse；不在show把height重新限制252...412、不取鼠标屏幕、不加screenheight-80。原show还有transitionGeneration/closedWindowManager/内容滑入动画等，本轮不重写。"
    },
    {
      "stage": "screen changed",
      "function": "f018de4",
      "contract": "原weak originalScreen存在且与window.screen不同才取新screen.frame.origin/width，保contentView.frame.height进行setFrame(display:true)，并更新weakoriginalScreen。该生产链与resize时保持origin并存，不是每drag重选鼠标屏幕。"
    }
  ],
